# Tanawin Menu — security headers (Tier 2 of the 2026-09-01 suite work order).
#
# Cloudflare consumes this file as configuration: it is NOT served, so
# /_headers returns 404 while the headers arrive on every real response.
# A file in the repo proves nothing — verify with:
#   curl -sI "https://tanawin-menu.tanawinbnb.workers.dev/staff?x=1" | grep -i "content-security|nosniff|frame"
#
# ⚠️ THIS CSP IS ENFORCING. A wrong source here BREAKS a real screen for real
# people, on an app that takes guest orders. It ran as Report-Only first and was
# flipped on 2026-09-01 only after a full sweep of the live site produced zero
# securitypolicyviolation events: guest menu (cart, size options, bucket image,
# signature canvas), all six staff tabs, the paper-order form, the edit-order
# modal, the discount calculator, sheetjs loaded on demand from its CDN, service
# worker registration, data:/blob:/bucket images, and the update banner reading
# every asset.
#
# If you add anything that loads from a new origin, add its source here IN THE
# SAME COMMIT. Violations now show up as a broken screen, not a console note —
# and they surface on a staff phone, not on yours.
#
# Why each source is here — check this list before adding to it:
#   script-src   cdn.jsdelivr.net  supabase-js, on all three pages
#                cdn.sheetjs.com   injected on demand by the Excel export
#                NO 'unsafe-inline': poster's inline script moved to
#                js/poster.js and two onclick attributes were removed to keep
#                it that way. Putting it back undoes most of this file.
#   style-src    'unsafe-inline' is unavoidable for now — the update banner
#                injects a <style> element and sets element.style directly,
#                and two pages carry a <style> block.
#   img-src      data:  guest signatures and request photos are data URLs
#                blob:  the menu-item photo picker previews with createObjectURL
#                supabase  the menu-images bucket and the GCash QR
#   connect-src  supabase REST, and wss for the realtime order feed
#   worker-src   sw.js, which serves offline.html and raises push alerts
#
# Not listed and deliberately so: media-src (the chime is Web Audio, not a
# file) and font-src beyond 'self' (every font-family resolves to system UI).

/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://cdn.jsdelivr.net https://cdn.sheetjs.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://lkeuiquqogtevsgvaddf.supabase.co; connect-src 'self' https://lkeuiquqogtevsgvaddf.supabase.co wss://lkeuiquqogtevsgvaddf.supabase.co; worker-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), microphone=(), camera=()
